<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 26.</p>
<p>				  June 26/June 25  June 26/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.02		 7.30</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.02		 5.76</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.36		10.66</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.27		50.35</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    2.52		35.67</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  2.63		36.31</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.04		14.16</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.38		30.31</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    2.55		43.89</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  2.70		42.72</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.35		24.13</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.13		91.05</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,472,406,723,428</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,954,346,110,193</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,186,103,147,716</p>
<p>  International funds			    97,581,023,471</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    234,376,442,048</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
